
## [cb822f0] L local permission: only the channel's owner and moderators, by the real role matrix; a denied request makes no platform call
NOTE L0 real role matrix: [role, review.decide] :: [["CHANNEL_OWNER",true],["MODERATOR",true],["DATA_ADMIN",false]]
OK   L1 CHANNEL_OWNER of the channel: local block applied, then one removal request, SUCCEEDED :: {"local":"blocked","platform":{"operationId":"op-l-CHANNEL_OWNER","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"SUCCEEDED","reason":null,"attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"calls":["remove:channel-a:yt-msg-1"]}
OK   L1 MODERATOR of the channel: local block applied, then one removal request, SUCCEEDED :: {"local":"blocked","platform":{"operationId":"op-l-MODERATOR","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"SUCCEEDED","reason":null,"attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"calls":["remove:channel-a:yt-msg-1"]}
OK   L2 DATA_ADMIN of the channel: denied before anything else; no permission check, no request, no record, verdict still ALLOW, no Change Log entry, no quota spent :: {"out":{"local":{"status":"denied"},"platform":null},"calls":[]}
OK   L3 a moderator or owner of another channel: denied, no platform call, verdict unchanged :: {"out":{"local":{"status":"denied"},"platform":null},"owner":{"local":{"status":"denied"},"platform":null}}
OK   L4 an actor holding every owner capability except review.decide: denied, no platform call :: {"local":{"status":"denied"},"platform":null}
OK   L5 default local rejection (DecisionService.overturn to BLOCK, and an automatic BLOCK commit) makes no removal request and no read-back :: {"review":"overturned","calls":[]}

