## [cb822f0] Q quota: checked before every request, charged 20 units per request
OK   Q1 budget cannot pay 20 more units (15 used of 30): FAILED(QUOTA_EXHAUSTED), 0 requests, used units unchanged, local block kept :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-q1","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"FAILED","reason":"QUOTA_EXHAUSTED","attempts":0,"unitsSpent":0},"used":15}
