OK   S4 platform refusal 401: FAILED(AUTH_REJECTED) after exactly 1 request, no read-back, no retry; the local block stays (verdict BLOCK, BLOCK delivery still PENDING), the platform step adds no Change Log entry :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-s4-401","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"FAILED","reason":"AUTH_REJECTED","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"deliveries":[{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"ALLOW"},{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"BLOCK"}]}
OK   S4 platform refusal 403 forbidden: FAILED(INSUFFICIENT_PERMISSION) after exactly 1 request, no read-back, no retry; the local block stays (verdict BLOCK, BLOCK delivery still PENDING), the platform step adds no Change Log entry :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-s4-403 forbidden","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"FAILED","reason":"INSUFFICIENT_PERMISSION","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"deliveries":[{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"ALLOW"},{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"BLOCK"}]}
OK   S4 platform refusal 403 rateLimitExceeded: FAILED(RATE_LIMITED) after exactly 1 request, no read-back, no retry; the local block stays (verdict BLOCK, BLOCK delivery still PENDING), the platform step adds no Change Log entry :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-s4-403 rateLimitExceeded","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"FAILED","reason":"RATE_LIMITED","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"deliveries":[{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"ALLOW"},{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"BLOCK"}]}
OK   S4 platform refusal 404: FAILED(MESSAGE_NOT_FOUND) after exactly 1 request, no read-back, no retry; the local block stays (verdict BLOCK, BLOCK delivery still PENDING), the platform step adds no Change Log entry :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-s4-404","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"FAILED","reason":"MESSAGE_NOT_FOUND","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"deliveries":[{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"ALLOW"},{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"BLOCK"}]}
OK   S4 platform refusal 429: FAILED(RATE_LIMITED) after exactly 1 request, no read-back, no retry; the local block stays (verdict BLOCK, BLOCK delivery still PENDING), the platform step adds no Change Log entry :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-s4-429","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"FAILED","reason":"RATE_LIMITED","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"deliveries":[{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"ALLOW"},{"status":"PENDING","downstream":"BLOCK"}]}
OK   S5 an answer that cannot be classified (503): read back once; read-back unavailable gives UNKNOWN(VERIFICATION_UNAVAILABLE), no second request, local block kept :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-s5","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"UNKNOWN","reason":"VERIFICATION_UNAVAILABLE","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"calls":["remove:channel-a:yt-msg-1","find:channel-a:yt-msg-1"]}
OK   S6 the transport throws on the request: treated as unknown, read back; ABSENT gives SUCCEEDED(VERIFIED_BY_READBACK) with 1 request :: {"operationId":"op-s6","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"SUCCEEDED","reason":"VERIFIED_BY_READBACK","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20}
OK   S7 the read-back throws: UNKNOWN(VERIFICATION_UNAVAILABLE), no second request :: {"operationId":"op-s7","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"UNKNOWN","reason":"VERIFICATION_UNAVAILABLE","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20}
OK   S8 the four platform statuses PENDING, SUCCEEDED, FAILED, UNKNOWN all occur in the records above, and nothing else :: ["PENDING","SUCCEEDED","FAILED","UNKNOWN"]

## [cb822f0] U unknown result: verify before any retry, retries capped
NOTE U0 PLATFORM_DELETE_MAX_ATTEMPTS :: 2
OK   U1 unknown, read-back PRESENT (removal did not apply), then one more request: SUCCEEDED after 2 requests and 1 read-back, in the order remove, find, remove; 40 units :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-u1","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"SUCCEEDED","reason":null,"attempts":2,"unitsSpent":40},"calls":["remove:channel-a:yt-msg-1","find:channel-a:yt-msg-1","remove:channel-a:yt-msg-1"],"records":["PENDING1","PENDING2","SUCCEEDED2"]}
