OK   U3 a retry is checked again: after unknown + PRESENT the quota cannot pay a second request, FAILED(QUOTA_EXHAUSTED) after 1 request :: {"platform":{"operationId":"op-u3","eventId":"event-1","channelId":"channel-a","status":"FAILED","reason":"QUOTA_EXHAUSTED","attempts":1,"unitsSpent":20},"checks":2}
